# Dynamic formlayer migrations are generated at runtime and persisted via the
# GSS_DYNAMICMIGRATIONSFOLDER volume mount (see docker/docker-compose.yml) - they
# must not be baked into the image from whatever local dev state happens to exist
# on the machine running `docker build`.
server_backend_django/gss/formlayers/migrations/*
!server_backend_django/gss/formlayers/migrations/__init__.py
